// Cowboy From Hell: completely bald, a dark brown ribbed tank top, silver chain and earrings, grey
// jeans, big brown cowboy boots with spurs, and a whale tattoo on his left arm.
// Light is a punch that alternates between his right and left arm while you spam it.
// Heavy is a leap with three kicks downwards.
// Special (the tattoo glows when the meter is full) curses the opponent: a glowing blue ring with
// a petal glow appears round them, split into a left half and a right half. Hitting them with any
// other attack from the left removes the left half, from the right the right half; with both
// gone the ring squeezes shut and deals the special's damage.
// See ayz.ron for what each field means; leap / leap_vx / hits / hit_gap / curse are explained in
// src/sim/data.rs.
(
    name: "Cowboy From Hell",
    sprites: Some("cowboy"),
    color: (0.85, 0.58, 0.32),
    walk_speed: 210,
    jump_speed: 1050,
    // A third less health than the others (667 of their 1000).
    health: Some(667),
    // His special meter fills about 2.35 times as slowly (135% slower).
    meter_gain_pct: Some(43),
    special_mark: Some(Scar(color: (0.25, 0.5, 0.85), glow: (0.35, 0.72, 1.0))),
    moves: [
        (name: "Punch", button: Light, crouching: false, anim: Punch, walk_pct: 60,
